  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for Refusal\r\n\r\nThe proposed single storey side and front porch extension, by way of its positioning and lack of a side boundary setback, would result in the creation of a visually obtrusive feature, which would be detrimental to the local street scene given the sites prominent corner location.  The development is therefore contrary with policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development) and H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations) of The London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003; and is not compliant with Council's Residential Extension Guidelines.  \r\n\r\n\r\nINFORMATIVE\r\n\r\n\r\nThe applicant is advised that if the extension were to be set in a minimum of 1m from the side boundary with Woodlawn Drive, it would be likely to receive favourable planning consideration.\r\n\r\n"
  ],
